flowchart LR
    U[User / judge] --> UI[Streamlit app]
    UI --> AG[Agent controller]
    AG --> V[OpenCV 5 vision tools]
    V --> Q[Quality + dial/needle evidence]
    Q -->|clear and calibrated| R[Reading + annotated image]
    Q -->|uncertain| AG
    AG -->|retry evidence| V
    AG -->|still uncertain| H[Human verification request]
    UI --> AWS[AWS EC2: app + OpenCV workload]
    AWS -. optional, consented output storage .-> S3[Amazon S3]
